<section class="cta-section">
  <h2>Build a better room.</h2>
  <p class="cta-desc">
    Your agents are smart. But are they in the right room? 
    Give them the one thing bigger models can't buy — diverse perspectives.
  </p>
  <div class="cta-group">
    <a href="https://github.com/heybeaux/parliament" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      Start deliberating →
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/heybeaux/parliament/blob/main/docs/topology.md" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      Read the docs
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6rem 2rem 8rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .cta-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  }

  .cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--accent-glow);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>
